      solution: `$P(A \\cap B) = P(A) \\times P_A(B)$, donc $P(A) = \\dfrac{P(A \\cap B)}{P_A(B)} = \\dfrac{${dec2(inter)}}{${dec2(pBA)}} = ${dec2(pA)}$.`
